Tutor's directive (2026-10-02): in the math section only Foundation-level
(easy) exercises may be generated; Standard/Advanced/Challenge must come
from real sources. Until enough real material exists, non-conforming
generated templates stay in the bank but are MARKED:

- src/content/policy.ts: isPendingRealSource() + topicPolicyStats()
- PendingSourceBadge (amber, with tooltip) on the problem meta row,
  shown instead of the SourceBadge when a math problem above easy has
  no source
- Topic page: coverage notice 'n of m Standard-or-higher exercises come
  from real sources; the remaining p are generated and provisional'
  (math topics only, respects the active subtopic filter)
- validate-bank.ts: per-topic policy report — the tutor's replacement
  to-do list (currently 187 pending across 18 math topics)

Physics is out of scope. Existing progress records are unaffected.
